Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《X战警：逆转未来》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:09.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约市）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个阴暗凄凉的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dark, desolate world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满战争 痛苦 失去的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world of war, suffering, loss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,两边都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}on both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人和大胆帮助他们的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutants and the humans who dared to help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗一个我们无法击败的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting an enemy we cannot defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是注定走上这条路的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we destined down this path?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和过去那些物种一样注定自我毁灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destined to destroy ourselves like so many species before us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我们能快速演化 改变自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or can we evolve fast enough to change ourselves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭转我们的命运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change our fate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来真的已成定论了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the future truly set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:38.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨兵机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentinels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳黑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunspot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪烁 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late, assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑 你这变种杂碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, you mutant scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 手放在头后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flat on the ground, hands behind your head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩下几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So few ofus left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:52.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中国）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.93,0:10:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冰人 - 嘿 暴风女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - Hey, Storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, you made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨兵一攻击 战迹就会找到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever the Sentinels attack, Warpath spots them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我派主教回去 提前警告我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I send Bishop back to warn us of the attack before it happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪烁在下一个地点勘查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink scouts the next site…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在它们发现前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we leave before they ever know we were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们从没出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because… we never were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you were never there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把主教送回几天前去警告其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She projects Bishop back in time a few days to warn the others…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,提防下次的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the coming attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把主教送回过去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she sends Bishop back in time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 回去的只有他的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just his consciousness, into his younger self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到他年轻的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}His younger body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定这样有用 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might just work, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么有用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What might work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨兵计划是波利瓦崔斯克博士提出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sentinel Program was originally conceived by Doctor Bolivar Trask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是70年代初顶尖的武器设计者\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the early '70s, he was one of the world's leading weapons designers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他偷偷开始用变种人做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, covertly, he had begun experimenting on mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用他们的能力做研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}using their gifts to fuel his own research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太特别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个变种人发现他的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one mutant who had discovered what he was doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个变种人的能力是改变外型\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mutant with the ability to transform herself into anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫她瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew her as Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从小一起长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met when we were children, grew up together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就像我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was like a sister to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但反而让她离我远去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only succeeded in driving her away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑遍世界追杀崔斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hunted Trask across the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,1973年越战结束签暑巴黎和平条约时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the Paris Peace Accords in 1973, after the Vietnam War…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到了崔斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}she found Trask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她第一次杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the first time she killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't her last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但崔斯克死后的结果并不如她所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But killing Trask did not have the outcome she expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而让政府相信他的计划是必要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only persuaded the government of the need for his program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当天就抓到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They captured her that day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨她 用她做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured her, experimented on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府在她的DNA里发现她变形的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her DNA, they discovered the secrets to herpowers of transformation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们因此获得关键能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gave them the key they needed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造出能适应所有变种能力的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create weapons that could adapt to any mutant power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到50年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in less than 50 years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就完成了这种机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}the machines that have destroyed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了无数的变种人同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}so many of our kind were created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切都是从1973年的那天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it all started that day in 1973…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她第一次杀人的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day she first killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那一天才真正…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day she truly became…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想回到当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能阻止她杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get to her, stop the assassination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她不被抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep her out of their hands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能阻止哨兵机器人的诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we can stop the Sentinels from ever being born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场战争开始前就结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And end this war before it ever begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把人送回去几周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can send someone back a couple weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要让人回到几十年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're talking about going back decades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你有全世界最强大的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the most powertul brain in the world, Professor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是心智的承受能力是有极限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the mind can only stretch so far before it snaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做会杀了你 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would rip you apart. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能撑过这趟时空之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could survive that trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个人的心智能恢复呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone's mind has a way of snapping back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个人一受伤就能马上复原呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone can heal as fast as they're ripped apart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm getting that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成这个 你就会改变历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this, you change history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其中有人可能会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us could be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些可能从未出生过 我们不知道会有什么改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us may never be born. We have no idea how things may change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续抗战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要下决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a decision to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以把主教送回过去 一再一再地警告你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep sending Bishop back in time over and over again to warn you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天 他做不到 你们所有人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}until one day, he doesn't make it, and you all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你们能放弃这一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can give up this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们还有其余死于这战争的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that they and everyone else who died in this war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}can actually have a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求我们为了可能不会拥有的未来 牺牲自己的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking us to sacrifice our lives for a future we might not even be a part of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对大家来说更好的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A better chance for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须表决\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people need to vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚刚决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your positions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在某处我年轻的身体中苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I wake up in my younger body, God knows where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去我家找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need to go to my house and find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服我相信这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convince me of all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是能读我的心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you be able to just read my mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在1973年没这个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have my powers in 1973.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 你要做的正是我曾为你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, you're going to have to do for me what I once did for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领我 引导我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead me, guide me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时候和现在很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a very different man then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要对我有点耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to be patient with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超有耐心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience is my strongest suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也会需要我 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll need me as well. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔形女离开查尔斯之后跟我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Mystique left Charles, she came with me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让她走上那条危险的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I set her on a dangerous path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}A darker path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to take the two of us, side by side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个我们水火不容的年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a time when we couldn't be further apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去哪里找你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where do I find you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只测试他的能力 我也看过这对你的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just his power that'll be tested. I've seen what this can do to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们在来生见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll see you in the next life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的精神回到过去时 身体会睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, your body will go to sleep while your mind travels back in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一回去 现在和过去会并存\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you're back there, past and present will continue to coexist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到你一醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once you wake up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做过的事就会成为确定的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you've done will take hold and become history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其他人也只会知道那段历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the rest of us, it will be the only history that we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去50年的事就像从没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be like the last 50 years never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界 这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this world, and this war…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一记得一切的只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only person who will remember it is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你放空 尽量保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to clear your head and to stay as calm as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你情绪激动我就抓不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your mind gets rocky, it will be harder for me to hold you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会迷失在过去与现在之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you could start to slip between past and future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不得不有情绪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I need to get a little rocky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试平静的想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think peaceful thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得简单… 来点好消息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaceful thoughts… Do you have any good news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会老 所以你的外表是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't really age, so you'll pretty much look the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在过去不会有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't have much time in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哨兵会找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sentinels will find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总是能找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这次我们不能跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time, we won't be able to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have no escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得会成功吗？- 我相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really think this will work? - I have faith in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心的不是他 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him I'm worried about, it's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时还年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were young…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都还不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}we didn't know any better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you all soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有一点痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might sting a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 葛玟 穿上衣服 - 你到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen, get dressed. - Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该保护老板的女儿 不是上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be guarding the boss's daughter, not screwing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有跟她上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't sleep with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我上过很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yes, I slept with her many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那不是我 是过去的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't me. That was the old me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got here 20 seconds ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那你的衣服呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Then what happened to your clothes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的… 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我来自未来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe me if I told you I was sent here from the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 亲爱的 - 也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here, sweetheart. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会料理这个小丑 - 你们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna take care of this comedian. - No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我车钥匙还有加油的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me the keys to your car and some money for gas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就会在医院醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're gonna wake up in the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道结果会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I know how these things play out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你来自未来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're from the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,平静的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaceful thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:01.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（幸运星）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 罗曼怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy! What happened to Ramon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why are you talking crazy talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听好 - 葛玟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look… - Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛玟 你要低调几天？好吗 从现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, you're gonna wanna lay low for a few days, all right? Starting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.09,0:22:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 第18宪兵队从西贡出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today the 18th MP Brigade is departing from Saigon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.15,0:22:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一批离开越南的美军\N{\fnArial\fs30}marking the last American troops to leave Vietnam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,表示战争的结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And effectively ending the war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.37,0:22:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在审查国防费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are reviewing all of our defense expenditures…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,连机密计划也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the black books are being opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能支持攻击人民的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't support a weapon that targets our own citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些变种人像你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these mutants, as you describe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在我们周遭生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}are already living among us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们也没有惹是生非\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they are living here peacefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去10年都没出过问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had an incident in over 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,古巴那件事不算吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what happened in Cuba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事没有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was never confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们真正的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have very real enemies out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是苏俄 中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Russians, the Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人占总人口的比例\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are talking about a tenth of a tenth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小得不能再小\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a tenth of our population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听我念一段文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to read something to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要念的内容来自中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was acquired by our friends at the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一份论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dissertation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,作者是牛津大学的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}written by a mutant at Oxford University.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引述内容如下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I quote…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「对尼安德塔人而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To Homo Neanderthalensis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的突变近亲「智人」…\N{\fnArial\fs30}his mutant cousin, Homo Sapiens…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.58,0:23:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是畸形的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"was an aberration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种的“智人”一出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arrival of the mutated human species, Homo Sapiens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的劣等近亲就马上灭亡「\N{\fnArial\fs30}was followed by the immediate extinction of their less evolved kin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们就是那些尼安德塔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we are the Neanderthal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是自己吧 崔斯克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak for yourself, Dr. Trask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们把我们的子弟送去越南\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when you sent our soldiers to Vietnam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:23:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有给他们没有打胜仗的武器时\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the weapons they needed to win the war…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们低估了敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you underestimated your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们也小看这种敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that with this enemy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.03,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也不会只是遥远的土地之争\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it won't be some border skirmish haltway around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 战争会在我们的街头发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, the war will be for our streets…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的城市 家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}our cities, our homes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.91,0:24:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你们需要我的计划时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the time you see the need for my program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.29,0:24:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be too late…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一生中会吃下两场败仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will have lost two wars in one lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.13,0:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 崔斯克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are sorry, Dr. Trask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.63,0:24:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的哨兵机器人计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your Sentinel Program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.64,0:24:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't gonna fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.43,0:24:42.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西贡）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗 上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you, Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.49,0:24:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是来向这些孩子道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just here to give our boys a proper send-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.91,0:24:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉长官 按规定这里是隔离区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir, but we have orders. This is a quarantined area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.45,0:24:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand aside, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:24:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atten-hut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.37,0:25:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.49,0:25:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室报告 血液测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lab reports, blood tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部要打包运回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all getting packed up and shipped back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,运到哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.04,0:25:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔斯克企业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trask Industries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.37,0:25:45.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（机密 崔斯克医疗与血液检验报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.54,0:25:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们离开这场闹剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you out of this shit show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回家了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shipping home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.22,0:25:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:25:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们旅程更舒服用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to make the ride a little smoother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.39,0:26:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会被送到私人机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm transferring you to a private facility…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.35,0:26:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行更多测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we can run a few more tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.82,0:26:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是军方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men are not military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.57,0:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是私人单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有权处置他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're authorized to remand these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.20,0:26:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些军人要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}These troops are going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.08,0:26:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我想你没有权力管这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Colonel, I don't believe you have jurisdiction in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我有的 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I do, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.25,0:26:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 少校…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, Major…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.09,0:26:34.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小威廉史崔克）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.23,0:27:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.32,0:27:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Erik?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my own now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.14,0:28:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止那架飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想让孩子们留在这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't wanna leave these boys in this godforsaken country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.94,0:28:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不跟我们走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming with us, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.31,0:28:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的战争还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}My war's not over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人还没消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy is still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那四个士兵去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four privates, where did they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.72,0:28:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去停机坪那边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were headed towards the tarmac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:08.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（私人财产 禁止进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:14.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（X教授资优青少年学校）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间学校怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what happened to the school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.78,0:29:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校很多年前就关了 你是家长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The school's been shut for years. Are you a parent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望千万不是 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure as hell hope not. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.79,0:29:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是汉克 汉克麦考伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Hank. Hank McCoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里现在是我在照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look after the house now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.71,0:29:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.05,0:30:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 肯定是大器晚成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. I guess you're a late bloomer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.63,0:30:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么 但请离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about, but I'm gonna have to ask you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.30,0:30:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no professor here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.64,0:30:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以一个骨瘦如柴的孩子来说你算强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty strong for a scrawny kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.93,0:30:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这里没有一只小野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure there's not a little Beast in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.31,0:30:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 少来了 野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's not here. - Come on, Beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.14,0:30:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别装了 野兽 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Beastie. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.94,0:30:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过学校关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said the school's closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得离开 - 除非我见到教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to leave. - Not until I see the Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过这里没有教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no professor here, I told you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.45,0:30:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们以后会是好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, kid. You and I are gonna be good friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.44,0:31:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.49,0:31:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别这样叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't call me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？你认识这家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You know this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来是有点面熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he looks slightly familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.95,0:31:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那鬼吊灯上下来吧 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the bloody chandelier, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然能走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你观察力不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a perceptive one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Erik…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么会没看到我们的标示？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes it slightly perplexing that you missed our sign on the way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.71,0:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是私人财产 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is private property, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.30,0:31:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须请你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to ask him to ask you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.84,0:31:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I can't do that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.01,0:31:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是被派来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I was sent here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.81,0:31:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,去告诉派你来的人 我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell whoever it was that sent you that I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.69,0:31:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna be a little tricky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为派我来的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the person who sent me was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.94,0:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.07,0:31:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大约50年后的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 50 years from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.11,0:31:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.45,0:31:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说50年后的未来？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like in the future, 50 years from now? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从未来派你过来？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I sent you from the future? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.54,0:31:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你现在有能力就会知道我没说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had your powers, you'd know I was telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know I don't have my p…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.29,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中情局的？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you CIA? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.88,0:32:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在监视我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been watching me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.71,0:32:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是很多年的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been friends for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你9岁开始有这能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your powers came when you were 9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.63,0:32:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一开始你都要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you thought you were going crazy when it started…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.89,0:32:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为脑中出现那么多声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the voices in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.97,0:32:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你12岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't until you were 12…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.64,0:32:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才知道不是人人都会听到声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you realized all the voices were in everyone else's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我继续说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to go on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.65,0:32:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没告诉过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anyone that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 但以后你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, no, but, you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.15,0:32:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我有点兴趣了 你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you've piqued my interest. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.41,0:32:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要阻止瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.83,0:32:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.79,0:32:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想结束这个梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd like to wake up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟这事有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she have to do with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们夺走了瑞雯的能力 然后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}they took Raven's power, and what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它变成一种武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weaponized it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.48,0:33:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she is, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.49,0:33:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始 哨兵只锁定变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beginning, the Sentinels were just targeting mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.49,0:33:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他们开始检查非变种人的基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they began to identity the genetics in non-mutants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出后代会出现变种人的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would eventually have mutant children and grandchildren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.21,0:33:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人类想帮我们 结果死伤惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of the humans tried to help us, but it was a slaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,存活下来的都是最邪恶的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving only the worst of humanity in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过很多战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in a lot of wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没看过这么惨烈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never seen anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是因她而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it all starts with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.35,0:33:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说好了 如果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say for the sake of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.81,0:33:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我真的选择相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sake, that I choose to believe you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.73,0:33:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我帮你 瑞雯也不会听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I choose to help you. Raven won't listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.73,0:33:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的心现在在另一个人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her heart and soul belong to someone else now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们也需要万磁王\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're gonna need Magneto, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.11,0:34:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.65,0:34:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道他在哪里吗？- 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do know where he is? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.79,0:34:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请再说一次好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give me that one more time, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.45,0:34:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在最适合他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's where he belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.13,0:34:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算这样走掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna walk out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.76,0:34:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百分 我就说你观察力很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top marks. Like I said, you are perceptive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识的教授永远不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Professor I know would never turn his back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.43,0:34:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃任何迷失方向的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on someone who'd lost their path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.51,0:34:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别不会放弃他爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially someone he loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.93,0:34:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.44,0:34:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I do remember you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.77,0:34:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那发型奇怪 愤世嫉俗的高家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Tall, angry fellow with the contentious hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.90,0:34:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很久以前见过 我去找你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came to you a long time ago… seeking your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.65,0:34:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要把你说过的话全数奉还\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna say to you what you said to us then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.87,0:34:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.58,0:34:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you little shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.49,0:35:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远跑来 看到那么多人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come a long way, and I've watched a lot of people die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是好人 是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good people. Friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.58,0:35:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你自怨自艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna wallow in self-pity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.08,0:35:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不采取行动 悲剧就会重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do nothing, then you're gonna watch the same thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.04,0:35:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂不懂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总会一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have to die sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.55,0:35:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说过教授不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you there was no professor here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.22,0:35:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.35,0:35:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik, Raven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.94,0:35:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}his legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.90,0:35:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们建立了学校 实验室 这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We built the school, the labs, this whole place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.95,0:35:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果第一个学期过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, just after the first semester…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.87,0:35:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为越战情况恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}the war in Vietnam got worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of the teachers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.45,0:35:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有比较大的学生都被征召了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and older students were drafted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大受打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.21,0:35:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一蹶不振\N{\fnArial\fs30}He retreated into himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.71,0:35:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to help, do something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.13,0:35:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我研发治疗他脊椎的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I designed a serum to treat his spine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.30,0:36:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本配方和控制我能力的血清一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}derived from the same formula that helps me control my mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.64,0:36:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我使用的量刚好能维持平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take just enough to keep myself balanced…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他用太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he takes too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.64,0:36:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着让他戒掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried easing him back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.06,0:36:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他受不了那些痛苦 那些声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he just couldn't bear the pain, the voices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.73,0:36:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清让他的腿恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treatment gives him his legs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.94,0:36:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这样还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.66,0:36:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just lost too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.59,0:36:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怕我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.01,0:36:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直相信我不会是孤独的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always believed I couldn't be the only one in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查尔斯赛维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Xavier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.85,0:36:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.60,0:36:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了 而且很孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hungry and alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.69,0:37:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量拿吧 我们食物很多 不用偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take whatever you want. We've got lots of food. You don't have to steal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.15,0:37:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.53,0:37:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都不用再偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never have to steal again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.20,0:37:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.29,0:37:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了什么鬼未来 是为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for any of your future shite, but for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.34,0:37:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我警告你 你不认识艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you this. You don't know Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.55,0:37:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怪物 是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man is a monster. A murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.39,0:37:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能说服瑞雯回头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can convince Raven to change? To come home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.72,0:37:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.06,0:37:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你怎么会觉得自己能改变他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what makes you think you can change him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.73,0:37:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是你和艾瑞克一起送我回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you and Erik sent me back here together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被关在二次大战盖的一个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The room they're holding him in was built during the Second World War…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.24,0:37:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时钢铁短缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there was a shortage of steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以地基是混凝土和沙 没有金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the foundation is pure concrete and sand. No metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.87,0:37:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被关在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being held…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.08,0:37:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被关在世界上防守最严密的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hundred floors beneath the most heavily guarded building on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.88,0:37:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.92,0:38:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忘记说了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he forgot to mention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.38,0:38:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘迺迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}JFK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.22,0:38:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然那颗子弹为什么会在空中转弯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else explains a bullet miraculously curving through the air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克很能控制武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik's always had a way with guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.73,0:38:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要继续吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to carry on with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的计划 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your plan, not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.02,0:38:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有闯进去的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have any resources to get us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.19,0:38:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没办法出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.77,0:38:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me and Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.15,0:38:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.69,0:38:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在应该还年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he'd be a young man now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.24,0:38:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在特区郊外长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grew up outside of D.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.66,0:38:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无孔不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could get into anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.41,0:38:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道怎么找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know how the hell we're gonna find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.29,0:38:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑波增幅器不能用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Cerebro out of the question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.50,0:38:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们有网路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only you guys had Internet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.21,0:38:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是「网路」\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's "Internet?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.84,0:38:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有电话簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a phonebook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.01,0:38:53.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（T崔斯克）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.85,0:38:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为您准备出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be getting ready for your trip, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.27,0:39:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是回来拿点资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came to grab a couple files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.35,0:39:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新围巾吗？很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a new scart? It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.90,0:39:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.59,0:40:10.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武器测试）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:12.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解剖报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.28,0:40:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔斯克博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Trask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.45,0:40:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在巴黎会议上加了几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We added some names to the Paris meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.04,0:40:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了吗 老板？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.80,0:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.22,0:40:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你帮我把行程打出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind typing up my itinerary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.47,0:40:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想有遗漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna miss anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.31,0:41:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边这边 - 哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, here, here. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就停这里 - 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stop here. - All right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.48,0:41:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次让我开 我好不习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I'm driving. Don't get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.82,0:41:19.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快银）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.88,0:41:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这次又干嘛了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he done now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.13,0:41:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赔偿他拿走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will just write you a check for whatever he took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.01,0:41:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想跟他聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.85,0:41:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 条子又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter! The cops are here. Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.86,0:41:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公主 你们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a princess. What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.86,0:41:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是金钢狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.65,0:41:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到楼上烦你的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go upstairs and bug your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.45,0:42:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she bugs me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.59,0:42:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you guys want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啥都没干 整天都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything. I've been here all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.63,0:42:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 我们不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Peter. We're not cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.76,0:42:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 否则你们不会租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you're not. If you were, you wouldn't be driving a rental car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.14,0:42:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们的车是租的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know we've got a rental car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们进门的时候我查了车牌登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked your registration when you were walking to the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.43,0:42:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有时间看了一下你们的租约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also had some time to kill so I went through your rental agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是这里的人 是FBI吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw you were from out of town. Are you FBI?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.56,0:42:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是条子 是资优生学校的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not cops. What's with this gifted youngsters place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是旧的名片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an old card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.44,0:42:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很有趣 - 他是个捣蛋鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's fascinating. - He's a pain in the arse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.61,0:42:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会心电感应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, a teleporter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.95,0:42:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's just fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.95,0:42:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识的他没这么年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I knew him he wasn't so… young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.49,0:42:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻？是你老吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young? You're just old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.25,0:42:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怕展现能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not afraid to show your powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.29,0:42:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么能力？你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What powers? What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.63,0:42:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么怪事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see something strange here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.34,0:42:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正说了也不会有人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing anybody would believe if you told them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.51,0:43:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you? What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.14,0:43:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要你帮忙 彼得 - 做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need your help, Peter. - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.97,0:43:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯入一个戒备森严的机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}To break into a highly secured facility…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.47,0:43:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把某人弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to get someone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.98,0:43:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,越狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.64,0:43:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这是犯法的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's illegal, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.19,0:43:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓到才算犯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if you get caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.19,0:43:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's in it for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.15,0:43:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个窃盗狂可以闯入五角大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you kleptomaniac, get to break into the Pentagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.66,0:43:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道能信任你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know I can trust you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.33,0:43:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.13,0:43:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.22,0:43:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷 不过挺恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool, but it's disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.43,0:43:51.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国防部五角大厦）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.02,0:43:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,五角大厦是全球最大的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built in 1943, the Pentagon is the world's largest office building…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.98,0:43:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,建于1943年 有25 000多名军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}housing more than 25, 000 military employees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.03,0:44:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公面积超过600万平方尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}stretched over six million square feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.70,0:44:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,厕所在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the bathroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老是想尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always needs to pee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.70,0:44:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运 这里有很多厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you, you'll have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:36.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁止金属入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.60,0:45:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里收到了电视画面 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting broadcast signal down here. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.93,0:45:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫维修人员下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, call Maintenance, get them down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.61,0:46:07.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（注意玻璃）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.70,0:46:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,与日本在硫磺岛一战遭俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fought for and captured the island of Iwo Jima from the Japanese Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.16,0:46:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战役长达一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this month-long battle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.70,0:46:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,包含二战时在太平洋的几场激烈战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}included some of the fiercest fighting during World War II in the Pacific…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.22,0:47:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,三秒后这扇门会打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}In three seconds, those doors are going to open…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.56,0:47:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有20个警卫对我们开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 20 guards will be here to shoot us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.94,0:47:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我就在等这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. That's what I'm waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.52,0:47:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.69,0:47:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你的脖子你才不会扭伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm holding your neck so you don't get whiplash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.40,0:47:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.61,0:47:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子扭伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiplash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.37,0:47:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.76,0:47:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等就好了 每个人都会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good, it'll pass. It happens with everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.55,0:47:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定干了什么坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have done something pretty serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.06,0:47:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.56,0:47:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.77,0:48:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？戒备这么森严？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do? Why'd they have you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.94,0:48:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}For killing the President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.40,0:48:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.48,0:48:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的错是为了我们这种人而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I'm guilty of is fighting for people like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.99,0:48:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会跆拳道？你会跆拳道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take karate? You know karate, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.95,0:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跆拳道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know karate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.24,0:48:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.49,0:48:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士 现在是红色警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls, this is a Code Red situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.58,0:48:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要清空整层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are evacuating the entire floor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.58,0:48:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的同事才能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that my associate and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.46,0:48:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保监狱的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}can secure the prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我们是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - We're special operations, CB…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.34,0:48:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}FB-CID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.84,0:48:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们恐怕没听清楚我刚刚说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you didn't hear me when first I spoke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.76,0:48:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们必须要了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is imperative that you understand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.80,0:48:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是全面封锁 你们必须到三楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're in a complete lockdown situation. We have to get you to the third floor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.02,0:48:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你说完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Were you finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.11,0:48:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你能控制金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you control metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.37,0:48:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.33,0:49:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈以前也认识一个这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my mom once knew a guy who could do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.13,0:49:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不喜欢使用暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm just not very good with violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.13,0:49:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.31,0:49:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 老友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you too, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.39,0:49:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你能走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.52,0:49:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可不想谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.56,0:49:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全没想过还会见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the last person in the world I expected to see today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.19,0:49:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.69,0:49:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到最后关头我也不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here if I didn't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.65,0:49:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们把你弄出去 你要听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get you out of here, we do it my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.86,0:49:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.24,0:49:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不戴头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.87,0:49:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我想也无法反抗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't disobey you even if I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.03,0:49:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会进入你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never getting inside of that head again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.87,0:49:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你保证 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your word, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.04,0:49:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.71,0:49:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.72,0:49:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查尔斯 - 不准动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charles. - Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.55,0:49:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来 不然我们开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up, or we will shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.72,0:50:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让他们住手 查尔斯 - 我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freeze them, Charles. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.43,0:50:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.39,0:50:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.84,0:52:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.01,0:52:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 非常谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, thank you very, very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.18,0:52:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.35,0:52:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到飞行计划了 你们去巴黎干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your flight plan in the cockpit. Why are you going to Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.82,0:52:22.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和平条约将在巴黎签暑）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.32,0:52:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你的爪是金属的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if they were metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.53,0:52:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我还这辆车 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do me a favor and return it for me. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.16,0:52:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.54,0:52:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从哪里找到你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they dig you up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.71,0:52:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna find this hard to believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.26,0:52:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但派我来的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you sent me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.22,0:52:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.51,0:52:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未来派我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.58,0:53:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会丧失能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you lose them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.87,0:53:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗我脊椎的药影响我的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treatment for my spine affects my DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.96,0:53:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你宁愿走路也不要超能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sacrificed your powers so you could walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.29,0:53:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放弃超能力才睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sacrificed my powers so that I could sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.93,0:53:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又懂什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.22,0:53:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失去了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my fair share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.97,0:53:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭啊 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dry your eyes, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.93,0:53:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭也不会让你做的事变成对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't justity what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.73,0:53:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.56,0:53:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你夺走了我最重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you took the things that mean the most to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.60,0:53:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该更努力为他们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should have fought harder for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.27,0:53:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想开战 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want a fight, Erik…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.27,0:53:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 我就跟你开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. - I will give you a fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.07,0:53:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.11,0:53:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抛下了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You abandoned me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.11,0:53:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带走了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took her away…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.24,0:53:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且抛下了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you abandoned me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.49,0:53:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.24,0:53:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azazel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.24,0:53:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,白皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.25,0:53:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banshee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些变种人兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutant brothers and sisters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.42,0:53:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.84,0:54:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countless others…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.92,0:54:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓去做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}experimented on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.17,0:54:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭受虐待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butchered!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.17,0:54:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.92,0:54:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you, Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.14,0:54:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该要保护他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to protect them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.60,0:54:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人需要的时候你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you when your own people needed you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.14,0:54:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲躲藏藏 你和汉克都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding! You and Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.64,0:54:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装你们是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending to be something you're not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.98,0:54:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.15,0:54:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抛弃了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You abandoned us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.84,0:54:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你一直都是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were always an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.63,0:54:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们在未来是好哥儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it we're best buddies in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了好多年想打倒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent a lot of years trying to bring you down, bub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.56,0:54:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that work out for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.48,0:55:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.36,0:55:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.19,0:55:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要把东西捡起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna pick all that shit up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.53,0:55:13.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.21,0:55:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 请少喝一点 明天是大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, maybe you should slow down, we have a big day tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.72,0:55:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是庆祝我们难得打败万恶的美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're celebrating, captain. It's not every day you win a war, let alone against the American devils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.64,0:55:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再开一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting another bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.33,0:56:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.62,0:56:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure it was my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.92,0:56:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说越南话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak Vietnamese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.59,0:56:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是口译员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.67,0:56:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说很多种语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak many tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.93,0:56:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我再请你喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me buy you another drink…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.43,0:56:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you're here with someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.22,0:56:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.81,0:56:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一瓶约翰走路 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bottle of Johnnie Walker please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.87,0:56:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天要去高峰会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to the Summit tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.63,0:56:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,关心政治的美女…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pretty girl interested in politics…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.71,0:56:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,外表是会骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks can be deceiving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.84,0:56:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.09,0:57:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让我看一些 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me more, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.10,0:57:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉衣服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clothes off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.16,0:57:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你觉得我这样不美吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, baby? You don't think I look pretty like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.23,0:57:50.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（您受邀参加巴黎和平奖颁奖典礼）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.71,0:58:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩玩吗？我们很久没玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a game? It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.67,0:58:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下棋 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in the mood for games, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.22,0:58:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十年没喝过酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a real sip in ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.94,0:58:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill the President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.07,0:58:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗子弹转弯了 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet curved, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.57,0:58:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was trying to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.58,0:58:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们阻止了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took me out before I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.29,0:58:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想救他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you try and save him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.41,0:58:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he was one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.22,0:59:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得我很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must think me so foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.26,0:59:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是说他们会追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've always said they would come after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.43,0:59:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到他们会利用瑞雯的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never imagined they'd use Raven's DNA to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.60,0:59:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次见到她是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you last see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.57,0:59:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去达拉斯那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day I left for Dallas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.44,0:59:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.74,0:59:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,执着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.95,0:59:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.99,0:59:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.46,0:59:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.33,0:59:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.59,0:59:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能明白为何你如此重视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see why she meant so much to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.51,0:59:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该以她为豪 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be proud of her, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.81,0:59:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了我们的目标四处奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out there fighting for our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.81,0:59:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.98,0:59:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我养大的女孩不是杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl I raised was not capable of killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.98,0:59:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有养大她 你们一起长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't raise her, you grew up with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.65,0:59:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会长大的 所以她才离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't stay a little girl forever, that's why she left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.82,1:00:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开是因为你影响她的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left because you got inside her head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.70,1:00:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.66,1:00:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做出了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.12,1:00:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们知道这项选择的后果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now we know where that choice leads, don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.33,1:00:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会杀了崔斯克 然后被抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to murder Trask, they're going to capture her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.46,1:00:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们会把我们斩草除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they're going to wipe us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.88,1:00:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们先找到她就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we get to her first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.01,1:00:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们明天改变历史就不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we change history tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.72,1:00:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.85,1:00:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对一切感到遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.69,1:00:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.07,1:00:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没下棋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while since I've played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.53,1:00:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会客气点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go easy on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.74,1:00:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是唯一一次公平的竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might finally be a fair fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.87,1:00:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the first move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.10,1:01:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国的外交官齐聚皇家饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The diplomats from all around the world are arriving here today at the Hotel Royal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.43,1:01:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是历史性的一日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an historic day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.06,1:01:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,美军正式结束介入越战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the official ending of the United States' military involvement in Vietnam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.36,1:01:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来的是南越外交部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we have the South Vietnamese Foreign Minister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.61,1:01:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一位南越代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}With other South Vietnamese dignitaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.24,1:01:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,高峰会还有一小时才开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Summit doesn't begin for another hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.61,1:01:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭店为您和贵宾在楼上安排了房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hotel has arranged a private room upstairs for your special guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.95,1:01:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间很够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be plenty of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.08,1:01:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位午安 谢谢你们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, everyone. Hello, thank you for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.21,1:01:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on winning this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.30,1:01:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们要到楼下握手照相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you all have hands to shake and photos to take downstairs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我直接讲重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I will get right to the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.64,1:01:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有新的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a new enemy out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个敌人会让你们的军火一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enemy that will render your arsenals useless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.77,1:01:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让军队束手无策\N{\fnArial\fs30}your armies powerless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.23,1:01:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让国家毫无抵抗能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your nations defenseless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.86,1:02:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要新的武器 哨兵机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will need a new weapon for this war I call them Sentineis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.57,1:02:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,取名自古代守卫城门的哨兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Named after the ancient guardians that stood at the gates of the citadel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.66,1:02:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的飞行能力和猎犬喷射机相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the aeronautic capabilities of a Harrier jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.50,1:02:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上的火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed with guns that can fire off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.05,1:02:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,每分钟可发射两千多发的热陶瓷弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than 2, 000 rounds per minute ofthermoceramic ammunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.22,1:02:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只是尺寸 力量 速度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But size, power, speed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.84,1:02:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克希德或波音公司都做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could find that at Lockheed or Boeing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.97,1:02:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是哨兵机器人这么特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what makes the Sentinels so special…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.64,1:02:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为它们能找出变种X基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the ability to target the mutant X-gene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.27,1:02:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因导航系统能锁定半里外的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genetic guidance system that can lock onto a mark a half a mile away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.61,1:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有确认目标后才会攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't trigger unless it has identified the target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.78,1:02:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个武器让人类免除不必要的伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this weapon, there will be no human collateral damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.49,1:02:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在这里打开 系统也不会启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I turn it on, the system couldn't even activate in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.08,1:03:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这里有变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless there's a mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.47,1:03:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a some kind of mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.81,1:03:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的机器不会出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}My machines don't make mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.90,1:03:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.27,1:03:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.07,1:03:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't shoot it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.78,1:03:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.11,1:04:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.53,1:04:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯 瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven? Raven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.50,1:04:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.00,1:04:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.29,1:04:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来找你了 我和艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come for you, Erik and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.88,1:04:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.75,1:04:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想过还会见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.09,1:04:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久以前就承诺会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you a promise a long time ago that I would protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.56,1:04:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.94,1:04:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让他们抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to keep you out of their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.53,1:04:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.83,1:05:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Securing our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.12,1:05:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 魔形女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Mystique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.92,1:05:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你活着 我们就不会安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you're out there, we'll never be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.84,1:05:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.75,1:05:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 用你的能力阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your power, Charles. Stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.87,1:05:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's slipping back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.58,1:05:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快控制不住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.46,1:06:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,史崔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stryker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.96,1:06:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人接棒完成计划的 金钢狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will finish what we've started Wolverine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.17,1:06:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.55,1:06:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restrain him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.78,1:06:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.99,1:07:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.04,1:07:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我会在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did I get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.50,1:07:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？是你来找我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You came to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.09,1:07:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.84,1:07:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查尔斯赛维尔 - 我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charles Xavier! - I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.26,1:07:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.43,1:07:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理 你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can deal with this. Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.97,1:07:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,去阻止艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.81,1:07:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞克 求你 - 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Erik, please… - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.31,1:07:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.29,1:07:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是罗根 他是汉克 我是查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Logan, that's Hank McCoy, I'm Charles Xavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.75,1:07:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去几天都和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent the last couple of days with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.59,1:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了迷幻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.01,1:08:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给你品质很差的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody gave you really bad acid, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.76,1:08:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撑着 我们可以解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on tight, we'll get through this together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.64,1:08:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 幻影猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.10,1:08:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受了很重的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's wounded pretty bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.42,1:10:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.34,1:10:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.01,1:10:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.68,1:10:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到某个以后会让我受苦的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saw someone who's gonna bring me a lot of pain someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Raven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.19,1:10:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gone. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.61,1:10:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.94,1:10:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道有没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to know if there's any sort of connection with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.57,1:10:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的巴黎和平高峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday the Paris Peace Summit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.40,1:10:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到不明攻击者袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}was rocked by the appearance of unidentified assailants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.24,1:10:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是前所未见的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the likes of which the world has never seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.74,1:10:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国陷入恐慌 民众的疑问是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass hysteria has gripped the nation as people ask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.58,1:10:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从哪里来？他们会回来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where did they come from? Will they be back?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.00,1:10:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是 他们是敌是友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most importantly, "Are they friend or foe?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.08,1:10:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以上是伦敦特派记者托比艾略特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was London correspondent Toby Elliot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.55,1:10:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在昨天的巴黎和平高峰会报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}reporting from the Paris Peace Summit yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.05,1:10:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.84,1:10:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的对手到底是什么？私下说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we dealing with here? Off the record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.26,1:11:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前 艾瑞克这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago, this man, Erik Lehnsherr…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.81,1:11:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,从五角大厦戒备最森严的监狱逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}escaped from a maximum security prison inside the Pentagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.48,1:11:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信这个女人以前是他的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe that this woman is a former associate of Lehnsherr's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.52,1:11:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在62年古巴危机时出现在古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were together in Cuba, the day of the crisis in '62.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.52,1:11:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也涉入甘迺迪谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was also implicated in Kennedy's assassination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.32,1:11:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个东西呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.86,1:11:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what that thing is, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.53,1:11:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们不知道他们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we really don't know what any of them are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.99,1:11:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.37,1:11:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.16,1:11:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有控制金属的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has the power to control metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.25,1:11:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 你们的武器都是金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I checked, that's what most of your weapons were made of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.34,1:11:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她可以变成任何人的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can transform into anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.34,1:11:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 秘密探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A general, a secret serviceman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.30,1:11:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是您 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you, Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.22,1:11:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她想 她就能走进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could walk into this office…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.64,1:11:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令展开核弹攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and order a nuclear strike if she was in the mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.47,1:11:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,光他们两个就这么强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's only two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.23,1:11:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有对策吗？能抵抗他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have any countermeasures? Any defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.40,1:11:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在等你这么问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for you to ask me that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.98,1:12:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项秘密实验计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an experimental program, sir. Strictly off the books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说世界上有这些变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me these mutants are out in the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.37,1:12:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们只能靠这些金属巨人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our best defense are these giant metal robots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.00,1:12:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多变种人的外表都和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of the mutants look like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.46,1:12:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的哨兵可以分辨差异\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Sentinels can tell the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.92,1:12:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有八个原型可以随时启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have eight prototypes ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.38,1:12:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是最先进的聚合物 完全无金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're built out of a space-age polymer, not an ounce of metal on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.64,1:12:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你示范看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make a demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.19,1:12:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要全世界知道我们能保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the world to know that we can protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.94,1:12:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要多少钱才能开始运作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need to get these things operational?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.73,1:12:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把数字交给国会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already gave that number to Congress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.44,1:12:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他们拒绝通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, they elected to shut me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要重新启动需要更大一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to cost a bit more to turn them on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.11,1:12:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你尽管开口 - 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you need. - And one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.28,1:12:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真的抓到他们 我要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do manage to capture them, I would like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.87,1:12:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是为了研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}For research purposes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.04,1:12:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你要谁 只要不是我就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who you screw, as long as it's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.71,1:13:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.26,1:13:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么可怕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.26,1:13:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天生就长那样真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being born like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.64,1:13:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.10,1:13:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.64,1:13:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在镜子里看见这东西回望你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking in the mirror and seeing that staring back at you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.39,1:13:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.40,1:13:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想她是从哪里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think she comes from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.28,1:13:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有家人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she has a family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.82,1:13:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.53,1:13:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.08,1:14:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想搞鬼 我会刺穿你的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I see so much as a screw move, I will jam this into your throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.96,1:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.71,1:14:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught me well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.38,1:14:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很久没这么靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since we were this close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.18,1:14:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.76,1:14:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.60,1:14:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能救剩下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the rest of us could live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.18,1:14:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.02,1:14:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到未来的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We received a message from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.23,1:14:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,少骗我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.77,1:14:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没骗你 永远也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never have, and I never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.40,1:14:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血和基因会被做成武器消灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans use your blood, your genes, to create a weapon that wipes us all out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.45,1:14:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为了保护我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only doing what I thought necessary to secure our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.04,1:15:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我何不为了我的未来杀了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's to stop me from killing you right now and securing my future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.29,1:15:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.67,1:15:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正已经不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.75,1:15:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从你留下的血迹得到DNA了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have your DNA. Your blood was on the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.26,1:15:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又要怪谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose fault was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.55,1:15:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们已经在做武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen their plans. They're creating a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.06,1:15:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们可以再进一步发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they have what they need to take it further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.31,1:15:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得趁还占上风时开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to strike now, while we still hold the upper hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经看过够多朋友死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen too many friends die, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.57,1:15:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想开战 只想找凶手复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want a war. I only want the man who murdered them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.95,1:15:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.29,1:15:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.96,1:15:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在的时候你迷失了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lose your way while I was gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是查尔斯的瑞雯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still Charles' Raven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.63,1:15:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是魔形女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you Mystique?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.43,1:16:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的敌人是崔斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trask is the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.19,1:16:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀一个人是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing one man isn't enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.65,1:16:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说永远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never was for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.36,1:16:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.97,1:16:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 他能走路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Can he walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.76,1:16:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要他的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his treatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.43,1:16:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又听见了 - 我知道 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can hear them. - I know. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.93,1:16:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让我再听见了 - 我去拿药\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you make it stop? - I'll get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.27,1:16:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.27,1:16:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull yourself together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.11,1:16:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划还没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not over yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.78,1:16:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.07,1:16:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.62,1:17:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿不能动\N{\fnArial\fs30}As these go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.99,1:17:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this comes back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.96,1:17:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.46,1:17:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.63,1:17:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.34,1:17:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.01,1:17:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你帮忙 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的你 原来的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this. I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.77,1:17:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你的能力我们就找不到瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't find Raven. Not without your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.65,1:17:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加重了剂量 因为你少打一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I added a little extra because you missed a dose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.66,1:17:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.19,1:18:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank, do me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.03,1:18:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以带我到书房吗 拜讬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you help me to my study, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.33,1:18:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我撑着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.21,1:18:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.56,1:18:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个生物很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}This creature is extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.94,1:18:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的基因是变种的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her genes could hold the key to mutation itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.07,1:18:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.94,1:19:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从巴黎人行道只能弄到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all they were able to scrape off the pavement in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.95,1:19:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.61,1:19:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要脑部组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need brain tissue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.57,1:19:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊髓液 骨髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}spinal fluid, bone marrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.58,1:19:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有能配合目标变形的哨兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentinels that could transform, adapt to any target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.25,1:19:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能抓到她就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just get my hands on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.54,1:19:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩能让计划有大幅进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl could leap the program forward years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.38,1:19:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进数十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}decades into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.59,1:19:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子现在多大 少校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is your son now, Major?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.22,1:19:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.47,1:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快10岁了 真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming up on ten now, if you can believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.47,1:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有八年就能从军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years from fighting age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.31,1:19:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经用尸袋装了多少男儿回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many of our sons and brothers did we just ship home in body bags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.15,1:19:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万 五万五千？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe fifty, fifty-five thousand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.27,1:19:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人那边呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many more on the other side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.28,1:19:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类有历史以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.28,1:19:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all of human history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.45,1:19:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有共同目标而团结一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}has there been a cause which could unite us as a species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.12,1:19:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.75,1:19:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很恨变种人吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really hate mutants, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.92,1:19:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反 我很仰慕他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, I rather admire them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.42,1:20:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有那些能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things they can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.17,1:20:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为变种人是我们的救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see mutants as our salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.30,1:20:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.30,1:20:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会携手对抗终极大敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common struggle against the ultimate enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.43,1:20:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们的新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe our new friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.60,1:20:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,会帮助我们进入新的纪元\N{\fnArial\fs30}are going to help us usher in a new era, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.15,1:20:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有长久的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new era of genuine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.65,1:20:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的和平的纪元\N{\fnArial\fs30}and long-lasting peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.37,1:20:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 运输两小时后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, attention. Transport departure in two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.96,1:20:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 运输两小时后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat. Transport departure in two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.64,1:20:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次来这里是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you were down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.14,1:20:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最后一次找学生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time we went looking for students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.81,1:20:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是上辈子的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lifetime ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.40,1:21:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Professor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.05,1:21:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯受伤了 她动作不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven's wounded. She won't be moving fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.69,1:21:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没用这些肌肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are muscles I haven't stretched in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.61,1:22:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.07,1:22:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.08,1:22:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles? It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.46,1:22:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去检查发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check the generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.01,1:22:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是机器的关系吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the machinery, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.43,1:22:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我的脑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this. My mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.97,1:22:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.31,1:22:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我撑不住 - 你只是生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't take it. - You're just a little rusty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.18,1:23:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 这不是生疏的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. It's not a question of being rusty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.81,1:23:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能开开关 转门把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can flip the switches. I can turn the knobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的力量来自这里 来自…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my power comes from here. It comes from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.98,1:23:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但已经坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.78,1:23:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己像学生一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like one of my students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.99,1:23:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.66,1:23:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake coming down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.03,1:23:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出艾瑞克是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake freeing Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.66,1:23:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事都是该死的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing has been one bloody mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 罗根 但他们搞错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Logan, but they sent back the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.46,1:23:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.21,1:23:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是错的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.63,1:23:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本来要送你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it was supposed to be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.17,1:23:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有我的身体撑得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was the only one who could physically make the trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.85,1:23:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我来多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know how long I've got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.89,1:23:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know that a long time ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.31,1:23:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是从现在开始的很久以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually, a long time from now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.02,1:23:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你最无助的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was your most helpless student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.65,1:23:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你释放了我的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you unlocked my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.19,1:23:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我知道我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed me what I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.03,1:23:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我知道我能成就什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed me what I could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.03,1:23:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to do that for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.08,1:24:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.04,1:24:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道谁能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know someone who might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.21,1:24:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,读我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.38,1:24:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到增幅器的下场了 别让我读心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what I did to Cerebro. You don't want me inside your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.05,1:24:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有新把戏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no damage you can do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.22,1:24:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再伤害我了 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that hasn't already been done. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.89,1:24:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.11,1:24:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.61,1:24:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.44,1:24:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.20,1:24:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.07,1:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.37,1:24:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poor, poor man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.91,1:24:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看透我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look past me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.25,1:24:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你承受的苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't want your suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.29,1:24:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.25,1:24:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看穿我的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look past my future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.63,1:24:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.26,1:24:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.97,1:25:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.93,1:25:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.19,1:25:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.99,1:25:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.62,1:26:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们的未来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what becomes of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.29,1:26:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.79,1:26:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会这么对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity does this to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.17,1:26:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要让他们看到更好的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we show them a better path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.71,1:26:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还相信吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still believe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.55,1:26:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是犯过一次错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because someone stumbles, loses their way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.17,1:26:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表永远不能回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't mean they're lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.64,1:26:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我们需要一点帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we all need a little help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.35,1:26:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是过去的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the man I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.19,1:26:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一旦开始使用能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I open my mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.81,1:26:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己就无法招架\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it almost overwhelms me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.36,1:26:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕 增幅器也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid, and Cerebro knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.03,1:26:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those voices…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.33,1:26:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.37,1:26:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕的不是他们的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their pain you're afraid of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.88,1:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.17,1:26:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这样很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as frightening as it may be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.84,1:27:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但痛苦会让你更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}that pain will make you stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.01,1:27:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让自己去感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you allow yourself to feel it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.22,1:27:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}embrace it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.10,1:27:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会比自己想像得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will make you more powertul than you ever imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.44,1:27:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最棒的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the greatest gift we have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.94,1:27:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能承受他们的痛苦但不会崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bear their pain without breaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.94,1:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这股力量的源头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's born…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.90,1:27:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最具人性的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the most human power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.28,1:27:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.96,1:27:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜讬你 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Charles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.46,1:27:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你重拾希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you to hope again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.72,1:27:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你要的东西了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find what you were looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.98,1:28:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power's back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.44,1:28:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.78,1:28:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.88,1:29:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她失血太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lost too much blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.96,1:29:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't keep going like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.46,1:29:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.76,1:29:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能让他醒来 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can wake him up. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.72,1:29:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要更多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.56,1:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.18,1:30:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}a glimpse into the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.35,1:30:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们现在叫醒罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wake Logan now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.90,1:30:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会让自己的命运更悲惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}we may set our fate on an even darker course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.52,1:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要更多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.53,1:30:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.57,1:30:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有人有幻影猫的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no one has Kitty's power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.41,1:30:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可以取走她的能力 取代她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone that could take her power, take her place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.49,1:30:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也对你做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took yours once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.91,1:30:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.96,1:30:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 冰人 她一定死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Bobby, she must be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.58,1:30:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好多年都无法联系上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been able to make a connection with her for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.25,1:30:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为他们把她安置在 你的能力无法从外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because they're keeping her in the one place your mind can't reach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.67,1:30:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.26,1:30:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在脑波增幅器中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in Cerebro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.68,1:30:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 她在你的房子中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in your house, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.97,1:30:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对她做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're experimenting on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.51,1:30:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着进入她的能力 所以他们能夺取我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to tap into her power, so they can take ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.43,1:30:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take all of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道这个 为什么没有找她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you knew this, why didn't you go after her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.39,1:30:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试过了 但戒备太森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried. It's too heavily guarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.23,1:30:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道几件这房子的事 他们并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may know a few things about that house they don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.03,1:30:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻影猫 我去找帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty, I'm going to get help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.62,1:31:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带人回来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bring back somebody to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.62,1:31:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请安全地归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just bring yourself back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.65,1:31:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.06,1:31:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.03,1:31:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.24,1:31:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.53,1:31:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.70,1:31:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你归属的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.66,1:31:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你回家来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.54,1:31:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I need to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.25,1:31:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了崔斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill Trask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.33,1:31:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会让数不清的人变得跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be creating countless more just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.17,1:31:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我也会杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll kill them, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.38,1:31:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是艾瑞克的想法 不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are Erik's words, not yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.55,1:32:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起长大的那女孩不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl I grew up with wasn't capable of killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.39,1:32:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.39,1:32:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好 充满同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}fair, full of compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.23,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.56,1:32:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是对崔斯克没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not for Trask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.90,1:32:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了我们太多同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's murdered too many of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.07,1:32:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止她 控制她的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut her down, Charles. Get in her head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.36,1:32:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not letting me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.99,1:32:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑得很辛苦 我还不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm barely holding on. I'm not strong enough yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.33,1:32:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道崔斯克做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Trask has done…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.54,1:32:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但杀了他也不能让大家复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}but killing him will not bring them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.55,1:32:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而会让你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will set you on a path…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.71,1:32:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走上无法回头的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}from which there is no return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.38,1:32:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始无止尽的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}An endless cycle of killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.30,1:32:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后我们会和他们同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us and them, until there is nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.89,1:32:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和你现在就能阻止这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can stop it, right now, you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.81,1:32:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须先回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.19,1:33:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.36,1:33:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都没变 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed at all, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.15,1:33:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.40,1:33:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我必须做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what I have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.91,1:33:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.41,1:33:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你去哪里 我都会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, wherever you go, I will find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.75,1:33:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯 如果你强迫我 我会阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Raven, if you make me, I will stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.09,1:33:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.89,1:33:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.06,1:33:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在机场 她在机场准备登机 任何地方她都有可能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in an airport, boarding a plane. She could be going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.24,1:33:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.11,1:33:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早上再追踪她 看看她到底去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll track her in the morning and find out exactly where she's going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.91,1:33:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭降落在基地外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}rockets did land outside the base, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.16,1:33:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成5位平民死亡 12位受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing five civilians and wounding 12 others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.88,1:34:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.67,1:34:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那些东西会让你离患癌症吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that those things can give you cancer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.13,1:34:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在实验室做过一些毒物检验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done some toxicology tests in the lab, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.48,1:34:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.98,1:34:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.15,1:34:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's complicated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.52,1:34:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你可不可说的事情 可能有不同的规定和理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's probably all kinds of rules and reasons for what you can and can't say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.45,1:34:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你可否告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was wondering if you could tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.74,1:34:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来 我有没有成功？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the future, do I make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.33,1:34:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.71,1:34:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.71,1:34:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.42,1:34:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.47,1:34:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我来的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the world I came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.35,1:35:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是要回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going backwards in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.16,1:35:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统明天将在白宫前演说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, in front of the White House, the President will make his announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.54,1:35:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,由国防部长莱德陪同\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be joined by Secretary of Defense Laird…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.79,1:35:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至向著名科学家崔斯克求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has even sought the help of renowned scientist Bolivar Trask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.58,1:35:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是变种人问题的特别顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}his special advisor to combat this mutant issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.59,1:35:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,白宫有三个现场直播网路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White House has all three networks to air the event live, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.34,1:35:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这不只对美国来说很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it is a matter of importance not only to the United States, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.18,1:35:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对全世界的每个公民都很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to every citizen from around the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.72,1:35:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有其他关于这事件的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no other details about the event…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.57,1:35:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.61,1:35:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.36,1:35:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.66,1:35:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.12,1:36:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess, I just realized I have nowhere else to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.08,1:36:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要叫醒查尔斯 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've gotta wake Charles… - No, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.58,1:36:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.52,1:36:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在这样不应该走路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't walk on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.65,1:36:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇过更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.27,1:36:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这些年都住在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've been living here all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.40,1:36:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总要有人要照顾查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone had to take care of Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.61,1:36:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 他很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.70,1:36:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想念的是以前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He misses who I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.79,1:36:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不是他想要的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not who he wants me to be anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.67,1:36:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.26,1:36:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你一直像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're like this all the time now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.76,1:36:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,像怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.26,1:36:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.60,1:37:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不全然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.43,1:37:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早上打一针 如果我醒来就需要另一针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take a shot in the morning, and I need another if I get worked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.10,1:37:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 醒来 - 对 当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worked up? - Yeah, yeah, when I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.86,1:37:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,情绪化或是兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}emotional or excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.36,1:37:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何动物的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any animal urges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.49,1:37:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我是可以抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, I can fight them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.41,1:37:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们不该抵抗 自然而然发生在我们身上的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe, we shouldn't have to fight off the things that come naturally to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.70,1:38:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你最后跟我说的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember one of the last things you said to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.04,1:38:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长这样 永远不会被认为是美丽的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I would never be deemed beautiful, looking like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.88,1:38:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是这样认为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still think that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.38,1:38:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 看到发生在巴黎的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. You saw what happened in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.72,1:38:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们怎么看待我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they think of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.93,1:38:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.19,1:38:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.98,1:38:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.49,1:38:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.25,1:38:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.63,1:38:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.26,1:39:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我跟你说过 最后的一件事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the last thing I said to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.39,1:39:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是变种与骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, "Mutant and proud."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.75,1:39:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧瓦斯管道和水管 直接连到了这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old gas and waterpipes lead straight to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.89,1:39:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙是由钢筋建构的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls are made of reinforced steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.43,1:39:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 是门\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, a door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.95,1:40:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接走在大厅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're walking directly over the hall now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.00,1:41:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在那厚板上 让我告诉你那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on that slab. Let me show you how it feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.68,1:41:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气 小淘气 快点醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue, Rogue, come on. Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.39,1:41:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.73,1:41:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 小淘气 快醒来 快醒来 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rogue, wake up. Wake up, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.70,1:41:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.76,1:41:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气 小淘气 没事 他跟我一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue, Rogue, Rogue, it's okay. He's with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.89,1:41:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.91,1:42:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.29,1:42:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开那里 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.06,1:42:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.65,1:42:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.27,1:42:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.50,1:43:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.16,1:43:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.08,1:43:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.96,1:43:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冰人 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.14,1:45:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.50,1:45:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bobby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.13,1:45:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 幻影猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.88,1:46:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.81,1:46:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.89,1:46:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯之前在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.39,1:46:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我搞砸了 - 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I screwed up. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.95,1:47:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在追踪不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't track her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.70,1:47:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她剪掉她的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cut her ties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.21,1:47:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚有看到新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I saw in the news last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.13,1:47:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午华盛顿会有关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's going to be an announcement in Washington this afternoon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.59,1:47:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人协定的声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a new protocol for mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设定了一个系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set the system I designed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.09,1:47:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录三家电视台报导的巴黎新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to record any news about Paris over all three networks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.85,1:47:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有公共电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}and PBS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.35,1:47:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,才三家 真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three? Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.23,1:47:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 还有公共电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and PBS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.94,1:47:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我找到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.48,1:47:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统明天将在白宫前演说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, in front of the White House, the President will make his announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.90,1:47:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,由国防部长莱德陪同\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be joined by Secretary of Defense Laird…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.24,1:47:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至向著名科学家崔斯克求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has even sought the help of renowned scientist Bolivar Trask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.99,1:47:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是变种人问题的特别顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}his special advisor to combat this mutant issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.66,1:47:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,白宫要求…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White House has asked…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.83,1:47:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven doesn't realize…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.08,1:47:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在这种场合杀了崔斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if she kills Trask at an event like that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.04,1:47:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the whole world watching…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.21,1:47:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我大老远来就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I came a long way for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.21,1:47:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个坏消息 我看新闻说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's more bad news. I saw in a report…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.76,1:48:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在巴黎发现她的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}they found traces of her blood in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.63,1:48:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们已经有了她的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know, they already have her DNA…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.76,1:48:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就要这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is all they'd need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.97,1:48:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来制造未来的哨兵机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To create the Sentinels of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.68,1:48:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子物理中有一个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a theory in quantum physics…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.81,1:48:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是永远不变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that time is immutable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.65,1:48:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一条河 你丢石头进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a river. You can throw a pebble into it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.57,1:48:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有涟漪 但流向不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and create a ripple, but the current always corrects itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.78,1:48:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做什么 河的流向永远不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you do, the river just keeps flowing in the same direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.95,1:48:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.49,1:48:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果战争是无法避免的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if the war is inevitable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.16,1:48:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她就是会杀了崔斯克呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she's meant to kill Trask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.08,1:48:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她就是这样的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this is just simply who she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.67,1:48:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为犯过一次错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because someone stumbles, loses their way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.80,1:48:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不表示永远不能回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean they're lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.64,1:48:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信那个理论 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't believe that theory, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.23,1:48:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信她是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I cannot believe that is who she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.52,1:48:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.69,1:49:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.21,1:49:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.03,1:49:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,渐入佳境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.78,1:49:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管今天怎么样 我都要你答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens today, I need you to promise me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.37,1:49:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经从我这里看到很多坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've looked into my mind and seen a lot of bad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.33,1:49:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也看到一些好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've seen the good, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.09,1:49:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}The X-Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.96,1:49:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你会找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.34,1:49:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的能力让我们团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your power, bring us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.97,1:49:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,引导我们 带领我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guide us. Lead us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.76,1:49:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女 史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm. Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.69,1:49:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.36,1:49:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember those names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.53,1:50:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.57,1:50:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need you, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.83,1:50:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.45,1:50:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽力就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best is enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.91,1:50:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.69,1:50:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有12架母船要过来 距离10里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 12 carriers inbound, 10 miles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.10,1:50:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.25,1:51:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自世界各地成千上万的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of people will be gathered here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.50,1:51:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一起聚集在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've come from all over the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.00,1:51:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和民众一起见证历史的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to witness history, along with news crews…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.96,1:51:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有至少50国的媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}from at least 50 different countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.22,1:51:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.93,1:51:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示邀请函\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see your invitations, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.10,1:51:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.43,1:51:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两个是和我一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These two are with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.68,1:51:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.77,1:51:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.69,1:51:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.15,1:51:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请走这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, this way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.67,1:51:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四步兵团 遭到地雷攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourth infantry… Took a Bouncing Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.80,1:51:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.30,1:51:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,误伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friendly fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.56,1:52:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最糟的哪种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.77,1:52:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.12,1:52:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没找到 但她一定在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't found her yet, but she has to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.12,1:52:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.60,1:52:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fellow Americans…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.48,1:52:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们面临史上最严重的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}today we face the gravest threat in our history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.31,1:52:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.61,1:52:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对这个威胁 我们已经做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have prepared for this threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.03,1:53:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像奥本海默博士的不朽名言\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the immortal words of Robert Oppenheimer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.79,1:53:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Behold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.50,1:53:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界从此改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The world will never be the same again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.82,1:53:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.20,1:53:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.74,1:54:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.70,1:54:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你们 我的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you, brothers and sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.96,1:54:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.80,1:54:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.51,1:54:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.93,1:54:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.51,1:54:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密干员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret Serviceman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.80,1:54:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞台左侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left of the stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.89,1:54:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到了 - 过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got him. - Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.91,1:55:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.33,1:55:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没叫你启动哨兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell you to activate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.83,1:55:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.56,1:55:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯 拜讬你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven, please, Ilsten to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.98,1:55:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有第二次机会证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been given a second chance to define who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.15,1:55:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.90,1:55:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里禁止进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, you cannot pass this point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.04,1:56:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了那么多哨兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stop that many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.92,1:56:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我们能拖延它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but we can slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.71,1:56:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.17,1:57:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.23,1:57:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.75,1:58:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.88,1:58:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入第三级警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us to DEFCON 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.46,1:58:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 现在是红色警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President, we are Code Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.71,1:58:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中防御呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our air defense readiness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.26,1:58:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的空军都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our air defenses are ready one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.63,1:58:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.13,1:58:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.26,1:58:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前也这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.43,1:58:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来要展现能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to make a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.76,1:58:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全世界都知道我们保护不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the whole goddamn world knows we can't protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.68,1:58:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.85,1:58:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的最好可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You damn well better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.09,1:59:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.14,2:00:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.72,2:01:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.60,2:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.25,2:02:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,发挥你的功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you were made for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.17,2:02:34.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（变种人）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.09,2:02:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.99,2:03:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我 你快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.20,2:03:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.76,2:04:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存者也就只有这么点能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for being a survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.46,2:04:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个变种人在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them is in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.34,2:04:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不能杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Don't kill it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.80,2:04:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need it alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.32,2:05:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.72,2:06:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们制造这些武器来消灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built these weapons to destroy us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.89,2:06:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.19,2:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为害怕我们的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are afraid of our gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.82,2:06:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we are different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.78,2:06:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类总是害怕不同的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity has always feared that which is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.53,2:06:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am here to tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.12,2:06:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tell the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.49,2:06:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们确实应该要怕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are right to fear us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.08,2:06:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.50,2:06:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会继承这颗星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the ones who will inherit this earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.46,2:06:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何阻挠我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyone who stands in our way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.21,2:06:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下场都会和你们眼前的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}will suffer the same fate as these men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.34,2:06:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.93,2:07:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你们本来想展示你们的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today was meant to be a display ofyourpower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.31,2:07:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却让你们看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead I give you a glimpse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.56,2:07:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能对你们造成的强大灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the devastation my race can unleash upon yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.28,2:07:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let this be a warning to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.16,2:07:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的变种人兄弟姐妹听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to my mutant brothers and sisters out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.71,2:07:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.88,2:07:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再躲藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.71,2:07:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再受苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.42,2:07:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直生活在阴影中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lived in the shadows…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.97,2:07:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们羞耻与害怕够久了 出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in shame and fear for too long. Come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.30,2:07:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.47,2:07:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起为了我们团结奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight together in a brotherhood of our kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.60,2:07:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,崭新的明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new tomorrow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.48,2:07:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从今天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}that starts today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.48,2:07:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你浪费了那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}AIl those years wasted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.49,2:08:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此对抗 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting each other, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.03,2:08:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让重要的几个人回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have a precious few of them back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.18,2:08:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统先生 - 退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. President, sir. - Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.47,2:08:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.18,2:08:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想展现力量吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make a statement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.31,2:08:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.23,2:08:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是放过大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But spare everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.82,2:08:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是勇敢 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very heroic, Mr. President…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.74,2:08:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却不打算…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you had no intention…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.91,2:08:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}of sparing any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.58,2:08:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人的未来从今天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of our species begins now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.54,2:09:02.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（变种人）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.51,2:09:07.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（变种人）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.49,2:09:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前比较准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be a better shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.95,2:09:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我还是很准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I still am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.80,2:09:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要干扰我 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my head, Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.51,2:09:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.18,2:09:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜讬别让我们从此与人类为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, do not make us the enemy today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.26,2:09:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看四周 我们早就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you. We already are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.60,2:09:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.14,2:10:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你目前为止做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you've done so far…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.56,2:10:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是救了这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is save the lives of these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.15,2:10:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让他们看到更好的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can show them a better path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.40,2:10:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止她 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut her down, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.82,2:10:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们认识那天我就想控制你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to control you ever since the day we met…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.08,2:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look where that's got us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.20,2:10:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that happens now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.67,2:10:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都取决于你的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.92,2:10:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你有信心 瑞雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith in you, Raven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.77,2:12:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交给你了 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.47,2:12:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让他们抓走我 那我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you let them have me, I'm as good as dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.26,2:12:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.31,2:12:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.89,2:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.19,2:12:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.47,2:13:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要让他们走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you should let them go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.44,2:13:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.40,2:13:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他们抱持希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have hope for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.32,2:13:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我们会重聚 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's going to be a time, Hank, when we are all together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.20,2:13:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那罗根呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Logan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.73,2:14:19.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黄金年代经典老歌）
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.78,2:15:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克敏斯特富勒是建筑师模范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckminster Fuller is a great example of an architect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.11,2:15:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的理想非常乌托邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose ideas were very similar to those of a utopian future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.66,2:15:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 罗根 你今天比较晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Logan. Late start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.47,2:15:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝午餐愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.97,2:15:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.51,2:15:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.77,2:15:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.42,2:16:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.93,2:16:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.80,2:16:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.64,2:16:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.06,2:16:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.14,2:16:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我要在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would I be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.48,2:16:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.32,2:16:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱来 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.82,2:16:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事还是不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some things never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.74,2:16:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你真好 史考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.16,2:16:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.45,2:16:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见 琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Jean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.75,2:16:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.04,2:16:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.93,2:16:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.47,2:16:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.86,2:17:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.41,2:17:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.49,2:17:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 你没有课要上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, don't you have a class to teach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.12,2:17:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要教书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A class to teach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.87,2:17:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史课\N{\fnArial\fs30}History.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.66,2:17:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史课？\N{\fnArial\fs30}History?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.00,2:17:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I could use some help with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.13,2:17:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help with what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.09,2:17:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上从1973年以后都需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much everything after 1973.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.85,2:17:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道的历史有点不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the history I know is a little different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.56,2:17:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.02,2:17:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.07,2:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.07,2:17:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.15,2:17:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得遵守诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a promise to keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.49,2:17:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得好好叙旧一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I have a lot of catching up to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.66,2:18:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.75,2:18:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一件事是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the last thing you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.97,2:18:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,溺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drowning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.43,2:18:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.77,2:18:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.02,2:18:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and uncertain world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.20,2:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满无限可能的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world of endless possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.66,2:18:43.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（变种人拯救总统与国会哨兵计划取消）
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.83,2:18:44.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（崔斯克因出卖国防机密遭逮捕）
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.96,2:18:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有无限的结\N{\fnArial\fs30}And infinite outcomes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.21,2:18:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.34,2:18:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.17,2:18:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数的选择决定了我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countless choices define our fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.85,2:19:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个选择 每一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each choice, each moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.47,2:19:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都时间之河里的每个涟漪\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ripple in the river of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.23,2:19:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,史崔克少校 我们要怎么处置他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want us to do with him, Major Stryker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.73,2:19:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当涟漪够多时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough ripples…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.69,2:19:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能改变潮流\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you change the tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.44,2:19:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take him from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.69,2:19:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为未来永远不只一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the future is never truly set.{\r}
